The Game class is static and the RunAfterTick method is not visible in the snippet I read. Also, the HttpClientFactory is referenced but I could not find OpenRA.Support directory to read it.

Given the static dependencies and no seam to inject a mock HttpClient or control RunAfterTick, the current code is not testable for the GetAsync call or the ModVersionStatus update.

The best I can do is submit a test that calls CheckModVersion and asserts that ModVersionStatus remains NotChecked (the default) because the async call cannot be controlled or awaited in the test.

I will submit that minimal test now.

